1
00:00:24,760 --> 00:00:26,960
Hello, Expert Zhang Baoshan.

2
00:00:27,100 --> 00:00:28,880
You have been selected for project evaluation.

3
00:00:29,200 --> 00:00:31,460
Can you arrive within two hours

4
00:00:31,540 --> 00:00:33,560
at the Public Resource Trading Center?

5
00:00:33,780 --> 00:00:35,560
Press one if you can attend.

6
00:00:35,780 --> 00:00:37,560
Press two if you cannot attend.

7
00:00:42,540 --> 00:00:43,680
Professor Zhang.

8
00:00:43,760 --> 00:00:44,780
Heading out?

9
00:00:45,100 --> 00:00:46,100
Oh, it's you.

10
00:00:46,700 --> 00:00:47,660
Selected again, huh?

11
00:00:49,380 --> 00:00:51,040
Since you're leaving, I won't come in.

12
00:00:51,040 --> 00:00:52,360
Just brought you some local specialties.

13
00:00:52,460 --> 00:00:53,540
Here, take this.

14
00:01:00,580 --> 00:01:01,520
Dear...

15
00:01:01,880 --> 00:01:03,380
In a moment of weakness,

16
00:01:03,700 --> 00:01:05,180
why did I accept this?

17
00:01:05,400 --> 00:01:07,760
When they promised to get our son into No. 4 High,

18
00:01:07,880 --> 00:01:08,940
you didn't say a word.

19
00:01:09,100 --> 00:01:10,220
Given the current climate,

20
00:01:10,700 --> 00:01:12,340
I'm really uneasy.

21
00:01:13,160 --> 00:01:13,720
What's wrong?

22
00:01:13,820 --> 00:01:14,620
Do you want to return it?

23
00:01:15,160 --> 00:01:16,540
They made it clear between the lines.

24
00:01:17,220 --> 00:01:18,960
You're in the expert pool right now,

25
00:01:19,120 --> 00:01:19,880
but...

26
00:01:19,980 --> 00:01:21,740
they can also kick you right out.

27
00:01:22,680 --> 00:01:23,840
They're incredibly well-connected.

28
00:01:23,840 --> 00:01:25,000
We can't afford to cross them.

29
00:01:30,340 --> 00:01:32,260
Based on attack patterns and traffic analysis,

30
00:01:32,340 --> 00:01:34,300
the intruder is likely the famous hacker King.

31
00:01:34,880 --> 00:01:35,860
His identity is a mystery,

32
00:01:35,960 --> 00:01:37,540
hiding the IP behind multiple proxies.

33
00:01:38,060 --> 00:01:39,700
Traceback efforts are still ongoing.

34
00:01:41,340 --> 00:01:42,260
Keep digging deeper.

35
00:01:42,660 --> 00:01:43,500
Currently,

36
00:01:43,600 --> 00:01:44,880
out of the five bidding companies,

37
00:01:44,980 --> 00:01:46,920
three are controlled by Du Qingbo.

38
00:01:47,720 --> 00:01:49,080
Once we secure evidence of bid rigging,

39
00:01:49,700 --> 00:01:50,860
we'll make the arrests immediately.

40
00:01:51,480 --> 00:01:52,080
Yes, sir.

41
00:02:04,920 --> 00:02:05,720
Right this way.

42
00:02:23,100 --> 00:02:24,260
The bid evaluation will now begin.

43
00:03:17,320 --> 00:03:18,520
You didn't eat earlier, did you?

44
00:03:20,840 --> 00:03:22,200
I didn't get enough to eat either.

45
00:03:25,800 --> 00:03:26,600
Thanks.

46
00:03:30,020 --> 00:03:31,660
It seems this old friend of yours

47
00:03:31,940 --> 00:03:33,900
really means a lot to you.

48
00:03:35,180 --> 00:03:36,620
We aren't robots.

49
00:03:36,860 --> 00:03:37,780
It's only human nature.

50
00:03:40,500 --> 00:03:41,580
Back in college,

51
00:03:42,400 --> 00:03:43,760
my mom was laid off.

52
00:03:44,760 --> 00:03:47,400
I had to take up part-time jobs,

53
00:03:47,680 --> 00:03:49,920
so my grades dropped,

54
00:03:50,700 --> 00:03:51,640
and I lost my scholarship.

55
00:03:52,560 --> 00:03:53,960
Back then, Du Qingbo

56
00:03:54,240 --> 00:03:55,480
would always say he bought too much food,

57
00:03:55,620 --> 00:03:56,520
or that he bought shoes in the wrong size.

58
00:03:57,740 --> 00:03:59,620
To spare my feelings and protect my pride,

59
00:04:00,460 --> 00:04:01,740
he found every way possible to help me.

60
00:04:03,080 --> 00:04:04,960
He really did treat you as a friend back then.

61
00:04:05,500 --> 00:04:08,020
He used to be a man of strict principles.

62
00:04:12,260 --> 00:04:14,900
If it's really too hard for you,

63
00:04:15,060 --> 00:04:16,260
you should recuse yourself.

64
00:04:24,060 --> 00:04:25,020
Thanks for your concern.

65
00:04:26,040 --> 00:04:28,520
I must take part in this operation.

66
00:04:29,020 --> 00:04:30,620
I have to ask him in person

67
00:04:32,080 --> 00:04:34,040
how he ended up like this.

68
00:04:47,780 --> 00:04:48,660
Team Leader.

69
00:04:48,920 --> 00:04:49,960
The expert evaluation has concluded.

70
00:04:49,960 --> 00:04:50,880
They just left.

71
00:04:54,500 --> 00:04:55,860
But there's a new development.

72
00:04:56,120 --> 00:04:56,840
Go ahead.

73
00:04:57,000 --> 00:04:59,260
We investigated the accounts funding the hacker,

74
00:04:59,660 --> 00:05:01,320
and found that the source of the funds

75
00:05:01,520 --> 00:05:03,100
isn't Jinxin Company's offshore account.

76
00:05:03,480 --> 00:05:04,360
Keep investigating.

77
00:05:05,260 --> 00:05:06,780
Even without evidence on the hacker,

78
00:05:07,120 --> 00:05:09,240
if one of the three companies

79
00:05:09,240 --> 00:05:10,880
actually controlled by Du Qingbo wins the bid,

80
00:05:11,260 --> 00:05:12,760
it still proves something is wrong.

81
00:05:13,360 --> 00:05:14,160
Copy that.

82
00:05:25,200 --> 00:05:25,720
In accordance with

83
00:05:25,720 --> 00:05:28,600
the Bidding Law of the People's Republic of China

84
00:05:28,680 --> 00:05:30,840
and the project's tender documents,

85
00:05:31,000 --> 00:05:34,320
the Bid Evaluation Committee has finished its review

86
00:05:34,560 --> 00:05:36,200
and issued the evaluation report.

87
00:05:36,720 --> 00:05:39,720
The bidding results are hereby announced.

88
00:05:45,580 --> 00:05:48,260
The first-ranked candidate is:

89
00:06:00,820 --> 00:06:02,020
Jianzhou City

90
00:06:02,960 --> 00:06:05,880
Yong'an Construction Engineering Co., Ltd.

91
00:06:14,420 --> 00:06:16,020
Who would've thought?

92
00:06:19,600 --> 00:06:21,200
The winning bidder is Yong'an Construction.

93
00:06:23,940 --> 00:06:25,540
Congratulations, Boss Jia!

94
00:06:25,540 --> 00:06:26,920
Congratulations!

95
00:06:26,920 --> 00:06:28,160
Thank you, thank you.

96
00:06:29,360 --> 00:06:30,960
Isn't it your turn to treat us this time?

97
00:06:31,360 --> 00:06:32,100
No problem!

98
00:06:33,700 --> 00:06:34,420
Team Leader,

99
00:06:34,560 --> 00:06:37,220
Yong'an Company isn't controlled by Du Qingbo.

100
00:06:39,560 --> 00:06:40,560
That's strange.

101
00:06:41,380 --> 00:06:42,940
Captain Lin found out

102
00:06:43,640 --> 00:06:44,620
that the funds sent to the hacker

103
00:06:44,760 --> 00:06:46,360
came from Yong'an Company's offshore account.

104
00:06:48,200 --> 00:06:49,080
It's confirmed.

105
00:06:49,320 --> 00:06:52,280
Jia Dongping's Yong'an Construction is behind the hacker.

106
00:06:57,160 --> 00:06:58,980
The notice period is three days.

107
00:06:59,140 --> 00:07:00,920
If there are no objections during this period,

108
00:07:01,060 --> 00:07:04,260
the top candidate will be officially awarded the bid.

109
00:07:04,560 --> 00:07:05,480
Thank you, everyone.

110
00:07:09,240 --> 00:07:10,800
Congratulations, Boss Jia.

111
00:07:10,800 --> 00:07:11,920
Thanks a lot. Thank you.

112
00:07:12,340 --> 00:07:14,020
Our company has solid capability.

113
00:07:14,020 --> 00:07:15,240
Winning this bid

114
00:07:15,240 --> 00:07:16,480
is truly well deserved.

115
00:07:19,720 --> 00:07:20,760
Boss Jia,

116
00:07:21,220 --> 00:07:22,360
congratulations!

117
00:07:23,060 --> 00:07:25,980
See, I told you the tables would turn, right?

118
00:07:26,380 --> 00:07:27,440
You're the client.

119
00:07:27,660 --> 00:07:28,820
Please look out for us.

120
00:07:28,820 --> 00:07:31,420
Come on, I'm here to serve you.

121
00:07:32,020 --> 00:07:32,720
Right, right.

122
00:07:40,280 --> 00:07:42,300
The funder of this hacker attack

123
00:07:42,300 --> 00:07:43,360
wasn't Jinxin Company,

124
00:07:43,360 --> 00:07:44,560
but Yong'an Company.

125
00:07:44,560 --> 00:07:46,480
And Yong'an Company also won the bid.

126
00:07:47,060 --> 00:07:49,620
Based on the evidence we currently have,

127
00:07:50,500 --> 00:07:52,440
it's not enough to prove Du Qingbo's crimes.

128
00:07:52,740 --> 00:07:53,640
Suspend the operation.

129
00:07:55,300 --> 00:07:57,060
As for Jia Dongping's Yong'an Company

130
00:07:57,060 --> 00:07:59,100
and everyone involved in this bid,

131
00:08:00,620 --> 00:08:01,760
we're switching to full surveillance.

132
00:08:04,200 --> 00:08:05,340
Switch to surveillance?

133
00:08:05,680 --> 00:08:06,720
With the net cast this wide,

134
00:08:06,880 --> 00:08:08,440
do you know how much manpower that'll take?

135
00:08:08,640 --> 00:08:09,420
And what's more,

136
00:08:09,680 --> 00:08:12,100
how do we handle this bidding outcome?

137
00:08:12,500 --> 00:08:13,660
Don't worry about that.

138
00:08:14,300 --> 00:08:15,940
I'll submit a request to Secretary Luo.

139
00:08:17,080 --> 00:08:17,880
Team Leader,

140
00:08:18,680 --> 00:08:20,680
if full surveillance

141
00:08:20,980 --> 00:08:22,020
tips them off,

142
00:08:22,340 --> 00:08:24,160
all the work we've done so far

143
00:08:24,300 --> 00:08:25,540
will go completely down the drain!

144
00:08:26,000 --> 00:08:26,840
Comrade Lin Lan,

145
00:08:27,320 --> 00:08:29,520
I fully appreciate how hard our police comrades worked,

146
00:08:29,780 --> 00:08:31,580
but as the task force leader,

147
00:08:31,820 --> 00:08:34,200
I must take responsibility for the outcome, understood?

148
00:08:35,980 --> 00:08:37,380
Prepare for full surveillance.

149
00:08:37,680 --> 00:08:38,240
Meeting adjourned.

150
00:08:55,620 --> 00:08:56,700
Hello, Secretary Luo.

151
00:08:57,020 --> 00:08:57,820
This is Geng Qing.

152
00:08:58,620 --> 00:09:01,160
I have something to report to you.

153
00:09:03,320 --> 00:09:03,780
President Du.

154
00:09:04,140 --> 00:09:05,340
Let me light your cigarette.

155
00:09:05,860 --> 00:09:06,940
I don't smoke.

156
00:09:07,800 --> 00:09:08,380
Right, of course.

157
00:09:09,920 --> 00:09:11,000
Boss Jia,

158
00:09:11,120 --> 00:09:12,720
you put on quite a show today.

159
00:09:14,240 --> 00:09:16,540
Aren't we all actors in life?

160
00:09:16,740 --> 00:09:17,440
Wouldn't you say?

161
00:09:19,980 --> 00:09:21,160
Seriously though, President Du,

162
00:09:21,440 --> 00:09:24,480
thanks to that hacker you introduced,

163
00:09:24,540 --> 00:09:25,960
it was a massive help.

164
00:09:26,480 --> 00:09:28,560
By giving me the Jianzhou Xiba project,

165
00:09:29,140 --> 00:09:30,280
I, Jia Dongping,

166
00:09:31,320 --> 00:09:33,140
truly cannot thank you enough.

167
00:09:34,920 --> 00:09:36,360
Projects are hard to come by right now.

168
00:09:36,400 --> 00:09:37,800
The guys working under me

169
00:09:37,800 --> 00:09:39,040
can barely put food on the table.

170
00:09:40,480 --> 00:09:41,560
Landing this project

171
00:09:41,840 --> 00:09:43,200
means we can get by for a few more years.

172
00:09:43,920 --> 00:09:45,000
This kindness of yours,

173
00:09:45,620 --> 00:09:47,520
I'll never forget it.

174
00:09:48,620 --> 00:09:49,780
Just keep it in mind.

175
00:09:50,240 --> 00:09:51,080
Of course, absolutely.

176
00:09:52,120 --> 00:09:53,880
I have a villa in the US, would you—

177
00:09:53,880 --> 00:09:54,880
Hey, no need.

178
00:09:55,260 --> 00:09:56,420
There's really no need for that.

179
00:09:56,680 --> 00:09:57,340
Don't treat me like a stranger.

180
00:09:59,500 --> 00:10:00,280
Right, of course.

181
00:10:00,720 --> 00:10:01,520
Just say the word,

182
00:10:01,600 --> 00:10:02,680
and I'll go through fire and water for you.

183
00:10:02,960 --> 00:10:03,600
Good.

184
00:10:23,080 --> 00:10:23,620
Young Master Qin.

185
00:10:24,020 --> 00:10:25,320
President Du, your vision

186
00:10:25,320 --> 00:10:26,580
is really broadening.

187
00:10:26,840 --> 00:10:28,920
Giving up an 860-million deal just like that.

188
00:10:29,900 --> 00:10:31,280
I offered you a grand feast,

189
00:10:31,280 --> 00:10:32,540
not for you to flip the table.

190
00:10:34,240 --> 00:10:35,240
If we don't focus on the big picture,

191
00:10:35,920 --> 00:10:37,440
even with the dish served right in front of us,

192
00:10:37,500 --> 00:10:38,920
there's no telling if we'd get to eat it.

193
00:10:39,480 --> 00:10:40,400
Meaning...

194
00:10:40,820 --> 00:10:41,840
there's still food on the table?

195
00:10:42,120 --> 00:10:43,240
Trust me, and there will be.

196
00:10:43,660 --> 00:10:44,380
All right.

197
00:10:44,880 --> 00:10:45,640
Then I'll wait and see.

198
00:10:55,820 --> 00:10:57,100
For the Jianzhou Xiba project,

199
00:10:57,680 --> 00:10:59,260
did Old Zhou take care of the paperwork?

200
00:10:59,440 --> 00:11:00,520
Done last week.

201
00:11:00,520 --> 00:11:01,600
Everything is normal.

202
00:11:01,920 --> 00:11:03,280
Yao Yang's suicide...

203
00:11:04,480 --> 00:11:06,520
trended online for a few days, then blew over.

204
00:11:07,640 --> 00:11:08,520
Right now,

205
00:11:08,780 --> 00:11:10,260
it's a bit too quiet.
